					"code" : "History s(0);\r\n\r\nsignal = in1;\r\nhz = in2;\r\nz = tan(clip(abs(hz), 0, samplerate*0.25)*(pi/samplerate));\r\ncoeff = z / (z+1); \r\ng = coeff;\r\nG = g/(1+g);\r\nv = (signal-s)*G;\r\ny = v+s;\r\ns = y+v;\r\n\r\nout1 = y;",
